WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:37.130
Pacifica is the Scrapped Princess?

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:51.170
"Concerto of Meetings and Partings"

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:53.670
Say, Raquel...

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.310
It sure is tough, not being able 
to do anything but wait, huh?

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:06.680
I can't do anything right, not even cook.

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.690
Come forth, Mr. Soopie!

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:14.150
A multitude of you!

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:23.570
Raquel, what are you doing?!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:28.040
I thought it might be fun if 
Mr. Soopie were helping us.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.460
I'll do it all by myself, 
so get rid of these guys!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.150
I can't have my valuable hostage 
catching cold, now can I?

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:56.150
I'm not sure if they'll come to rescue me.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.200
They might just abandon me and run away.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.660
That's how it's always been for me.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.990
Even with my parents dead,

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.520
none of my relatives would take me in.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:12.170
The owner of the inn couldn't stand what 
he was seeing, so he let me work there.

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.840
I didn't have any family or friends...

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.640
Do you want to get me to sympathize with you?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:21.760
You're lucky that you can at least 
remember your parents' faces.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:25.850
As far back as I can remember, I 
was in the Special Operations Unit.

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.930
I didn't have anyone to 
count on or to protect.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.130
I did as I was ordered, immersing myself 
in my training, risking my life.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:38.720
Of course, even if I did die, I don't 
think anyone would remember me.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.360
Are you crying?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.000
Crying? Who, me?

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:46.870
Not likely.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:48.790
But...

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:04.500
So warm...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.140
You're awfully persistent...

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:49.470
Watching you people makes me sick!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:56.810
You're protecting the Trigger of the 
Apocalypse that will destroy the world,

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.320
and yet you stroll in here just because 
a passing acquaintance was taken hostage!

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.070
You don't even have the guts or 
ruthlessness to kill assassins!

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:07.320
You think you'll protect the 
Scrapped Princess that way?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.360
What's the point of protecting her?

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.330
What do you hope to accomplish?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:17.840
You're just reveling in the 
self-satisfaction of protecting your poor little sister!

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.840
Maybe I am.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.300
No, don't! Stop!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:29.550
You're jealous, aren't you?

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:32.890
Of how they look out for each other!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.310
That's what makes you weak!

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.770
You'll be better off killing me.

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.290
But I won't.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.170
Something tells me that if I 
killed somebody to protect her,

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:11.100
she really would become the 
Trigger of the Apocalypse.

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:18.240
At the very least,

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.650
she's the type who would blame herself

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.940
if somebody got hurt because of her.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:26.230
Victory is yours.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:29.490
If that's what you think, 
don't show your face again.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.830
You're free to leave, too, miss.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.880
Please, go.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:41.170
I was jealous of them, too.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.900
Because I've always been alone.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.180
He lost, eh?

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.730
Thou art more formidable 
than I thought, Guardian.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:03.560
It is we, the Purgers 
of the Church of Mauser,

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.690
who will consign the Scrapped 
Princess to oblivion.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.280
There is the option of leaving 
matters to the Royal Forces,

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.910
but they do not comprehend 
the true state of affairs.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:17.240
I shall now bestow <i>true </i>power upon you.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:21.290
Through the divine arts of Mauser,

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.020
almighty creator, become ye now truly one!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:27.250
In the name of Galil,

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:31.340
fourth Peacemaker, humble servant of Mauser,

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.260
I now bestow upon you this miracle!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.490
Winia!

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.250
Thank goodness you're all right!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.880
I'm sorry I hid it from you.

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:15.720
I thought it would cause trouble 
for you if I said anything, Winia.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.310
But I still wanted us to be friends.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:22.910
C'mon, let's eat!

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.310
I bet you're hungry, right?

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.730
You, too, Shannon! We made a lot of food!

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.150
I'm gonna get a little sleep.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:29.980
What?!

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:33.320
You're the one who said to 
have a meal waiting, Shannon!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.280
We'll leave after we've eaten.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.640
Winia!

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:44.920
Uncle...

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.070
C-Come with me for a minute.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.930
I guess we got Winia involved, too...

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:59.800
If only I hadn't thought 
that we could be friends...

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.430
Good morning, all!

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:06.270
Wow! You're having such a 
huge feast in the morning!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.320
If you like, help yourself, Leo.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.570
Really?! Can I?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.480
This will let me work 
hard again all day today!

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:16.530
Wow! What in the world 
is this enormous thing?!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.490
Just shut up! Get off my case!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.990
Handmade by Pacifica herself, apparently.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:24.220
It's bite-sized!

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:26.320
I'll give it a try!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.800
Once I've eaten, I'll do some sword drills,

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.840
and then it's off to my Mr. Soopie job...

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.550
Winia, about those people...

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.090
They say they'll leave once they've eaten.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.880
They know...

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.550
They know they're not welcome.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:44.500
Chris!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.110
The mission was a failure.

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.110
It was a failure...

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.600
Major Sturm!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.000
Why are you here, sir?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.630
Does this mean that Blackhawk 
is also making his move?

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.290
To eliminate the Scrapped Princess?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:12.750
Yeah.

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:16.780
They've already infiltrated 
the city to gather intel.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.930
And if worst came to worst,

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.350
we were to eliminate all witnesses 
to keep word of this from spreading.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:26.430
We were to attack once the Scrapped 
Princess had left the city.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.300
That was the plan, anyway...

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.440
I've received a private 
message from the capital.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.560
What is it?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.740
The church has unilaterally 
sent Purgers into this city.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:39.580
Purgers...

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:43.120
Plus, they're carrying secret 
papers with the Pope's signature

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.340
telling them to eliminate this entire 
city along with the Scrapped Princess.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.250
The entire city?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.750
But that's crazy!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:52.500
Our mission has changed, too.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:55.350
We are to abort any direct action 
against the Scrapped Princess,

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.760
and observe their activity.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:01.010
I will go along to help 
relay the change in orders.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.760
That's a big help.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:11.810
Well, we're off.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.820
Um... About the room bill... 
We're a little short.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:20.220
We'll send you the money once we have it.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.660
We're sorry.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.710
I'm sorry I made you go 
through all that scary stuff.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.510
Still... I had fun here.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.900
She didn't even say goodbye.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.370
Once we're married...

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:14.370
I wonder if I'll...

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:15.460
be able to eat...

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.190
such fancy breakfasts every day?

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:20.050
Stay focused!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:29.140
What is it, Shannon?

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:31.520
Get inside. Enemies.

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:34.820
I'll make a break for it!

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.040
Message from Major Sturm.

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.580
Code crimson, 0037.

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:11.940
Hey, didn't I tell you not to 
show your face again, Axe Boy?

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:14.230
Actually, I prefer to be called Chris.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.640
I'm gonna smack you, you uppity kid!

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:17.400
Shannon?

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:22.610
The important thing is that 
that city is in trouble.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.420
God or demon, be ye here destroyed!

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:39.960
I'm impressed.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:41.990
Is this any time for compliments?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.710
Well, my orders are to stand by and observe.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:46.720
Shannon!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.150
Is this what Zefiris was talking about?

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:58.040
Hear and obey, humans.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.080
In the name of the law, I order you.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:03.570
Destroy...

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:05.740
Destroy the seed of destruction.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.240
Its name is Pacifica Cassul.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:29.510
Shannon...

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:35.270
Big sister?

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.770
N-No way...

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.440
Shannon?

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:44.770
Raquel?

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.100
Destroy it...

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:50.410
Destroy it...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.700
Shannon?

00:14:52.020 --> 00:14:52.900
Destroy it...

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.200
Raquel...? Why?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.410
Destroy it...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.410
Why are you doing what that voice says?

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.460
Destroy it...

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.210
Why are you two doing it, too?

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.350
Destroy it...

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:05.970
Big brother...

00:15:05.970 --> 00:15:07.210
Destroy it...

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.720
Destroy it...

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.220
No...

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.610
This can't be happening...

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.360
No!!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.790
I almost...

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.290
Big brother...

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:46.130
Are you okay?

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:48.300
Yeah...

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.300
Pacifica Cassul...

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.310
So, thou truly art the one?

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:04.730
Pacifica!

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:15.240
In that case, I shall merely swallow 
up any and all who know of thee!

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:26.670
I can't launch an attack like this!

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:31.760
Stop... Please, stop it!

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.810
Chris!

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:50.190
If you don't take out the 
core, you'll never stop it!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.940
But... The people who 
have been swallowed up...

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:53.860
I told you, didn't I?

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.400
If you want to protect one person,

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.240
you have to be prepared to kill another!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.240
No matter what your own beliefs are!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:06.250
I... I can't stand this. I can't look...

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:10.800
This is all... It's all because of me.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.590
Pacifica!

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.130
Hey!

00:17:15.690 --> 00:17:18.660
I'm the poison that will 
destroy the world, right?!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:22.640
Then you... Then you should kill me!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.700
It's stopped moving...

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:39.430
Raquel.

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:44.870
Bound beast, be thou released!

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.960
For thou art the rod of destruction!

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:14.350
The Peacemakers who safeguard order 
are meant to be above humanity...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:18.210
Pacifica Cassul...

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:38.840
Well done.

00:18:39.630 --> 00:18:43.220
That may have merely been a proxy 
opponent sent by a Peacemaker,

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:46.090
I am impressed that you defied 
the law in a human body.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.850
It is for that reason that you are the 
poison that will destroy the world.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:54.680
As well as the final hope 
bequeathed to us by our lord...

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.530
That girl is really her?

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.530
My, how terrible...

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.530
I hear she's got the blood 
of the devil in her!

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.170
Ready to go?

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:07.750
Yes...

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.250
I hear that she eats people!

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.800
Pacifica!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.760
We'll put your room fee on a tab, 
so come back to pay it someday!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.280
You hear me?!

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:28.980
Winia...

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:33.100
You really shouldn't say that. I mean, I...

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.190
I'll be waiting.

00:19:35.350 --> 00:19:38.230
I mean, it was my fault that the city...

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:40.740
I'll be waiting.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.740
Mr. Shannon.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.510
I couldn't say it before, but...

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.920
Thank you for rescuing me.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:00.340
Shannon...

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:08.860
Winia! Thank you!

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:10.850
Sure! Goodbye for now!

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:25.570
Pardon me! Excuse me!

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:28.970
They've already left?!

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:29.830
Huh?

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:33.290
What happened here in town?

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:38.420
That girl is strong.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:42.050
Way stronger than either of us.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:43.630
Shannon...

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.510
Raquel.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.110
Do you really think that 
we'll be able to protect her?

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:49.930
To keep her safe?

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:00.440
The Scrapped Princess is alive?

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.820
My little sister?

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:40.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:59.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:46.460
"Next Time"

00:22:34.340 --> 00:22:37.660
A flighty man with no name appears 
before the Cassul siblings.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.350
Believe it or not, this man 
who plays such dulcet tones

00:22:40.350 --> 00:22:42.500
is actually an assassin 
who is after a bounty!

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:46.460
Will Pacifica, who has collapsed after 
a surprise attack, ever wake up again?

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.160
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:49.390
"Lullaby of the Troubadour."

00:22:49.390 --> 00:22:50.470
Please tune in!
